{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-05_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-05","title":"낙하물","storyCode":"2-5","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"94e51c69ea8daac96b1237931b0cdb4f82211008b429e2f42ab2b1ce92ffdcb3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十七关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야! 서둘러!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"미샤 씨! 절 따라오세요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"어… 째서…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"이쪽이야, 서둘러!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"시야 확보. 적의 추격을 조심하도록 해!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"저 사람들도 설마…?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온 입니다…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"모두… 감염자예요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"어째서?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"어째서 같은 감염자끼리…"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"스컬슈레더…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"너…… 녀석들을 도망치도록 내버려 둔 건가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"괜찮아…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"어차피 도망칠 수 없을 테니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…중요한 건 그 녀석을 찾은 것… 아니…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"그 녀석이… 나타났다는 거지…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"도착했다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"……진심으로 하는 소리야?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"지도에는 그렇게 나와 있는데."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"근데… 더 위쪽을 가리키고 있잖아?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"여기서 위로 이동하는 게 무슨 소용이 있어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"아미야, 아미야! 여기, 그래 그래. 위야, 위!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…엑시아 씨."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"화… 확실한 거죠?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"날 믿어달라고, 문제없다니까~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":true,"text":"용문 길은 내가 자~알 알거든!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"아…하하……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"올라가지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"이건… 적에게 대놓고 포위해달라고 하는 거나 다름없지 않아?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"빨리 좀 해~ 리유니온한테 들키면 진짜 포위된단 말야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"쳇… 기다려, 너희 먼저 가 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"내가 출입구를 용접해서 리유니온을 막을 테니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"이 계단 벽에 펭귄 로지스틱스 마크가 붙어있어요. 여기인가요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"맞아! 앞에서 왼쪽으로 돌고, 계단 따라서 이쪽으로 올라와."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"그러면 건물 안에…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"지하에서 나가는 거 아니었나요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"엑시아","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"아니야, 아니야. 위라고 했잖아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"…위?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"정말 저 사람들을 믿어도 되는 걸까?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"\"목적지에 도착하기 위해서는 어떤 길이든 지나가라\", 펭귄 로지스틱스의 신조 중 하나다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"어쨌든 한번 우리 서비스를 경험해 봐. 분명 마음에 들 테니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"헉, 헉… 하아아…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"미샤 씨, 죄송해요… 저도 이렇게 될 줄은 몰랐어요…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"미샤","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"후우."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"어이, 거기 너."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"네가 로도스 아일랜드의 {@nickname} 박사지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"텍사스","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"계단 오르는 건 별로 안 좋아하나 보네."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["미샤"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["텍사스"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["엑시아"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["리스캄"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["스컬슈레더"]}]}
